  characterName: Jean Toussaint
  promptText: The IMF will erase our debts if we sell our public wells to foreign
    companies. If I sign, my children lose free access to water. Do I trade our birthright
    for debt relief?
  leftAnswer: Yes, sign for debt relief; it buys breathing room now.
  rightAnswer: "No, keep your wells; water is your children\u2019s birthright."
